                                                "sense_id": "5ba1eefc-6f84-3ace-a427-03e8958d272f",
                                                "text": "There were proposals to revive choir scholarships, because a shortage of regular choristers meant that weddings often went choirless."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45cc457c-bb3a-4517-a6e3-72896034f779",
                                                "sense_id": "5ba1eefc-6f84-3ace-a427-03e8958d272f",
                                                "text": "Since I was a teenager I have had to play different characters, negotiating the cultural expectations of a Pakistani family, Brit-Asian rudeboy culture, and a scholarship to private school."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "072cc302-098a-4d68-8287-c0d467999de1",
                                                "sense_id": "5ba1eefc-6f84-3ace-a427-03e8958d272f",
                                                "text": "There is a significant investment in scholarships and fellowships and traineeships, so that we are also making sure that we’re investing in domestic work force."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03be2011-884e-372b-b580-38d6377d0d1c",
